<title>FRANCE: France to sell 2002 BTANs in francs, ecus, Thursday.</title>
<headline>France to sell 2002 BTANs in francs, ecus, Thursday.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>France will sell between 19 and 21 billion francs and 600 to 800 million ecus of 4.50 percent, July 2002 BTANs on Thursday, the Treasury said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>France is selling for the first time on Thursday BTANs with the same characteristics in francs and ecus to make them easily interchangeable after the launch of the euro in 1999.  </p>
<p>Both lines mature on July 12, 2002 and have the same payment date of July 24.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +331 4221 5542</p>
